<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Sept 5 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1996/97		  1997/98</p>
<p> Mexico	 31,500			Nil</p>
<p> Venezuela     3,500</p>
<p> Israel	 -4,800</p>
<p>A total of 253,000 tonnes of sales were outstanding on Aug 31 and carried over to the new marketing year.</p>
<p>Final exports of 16,900 were to Israel and Mexico, bringing accumulated exports to 4,643,200 tonnes for 1995/96, down 13 percent from 5,356,400 the previous year.</p>
<p>Exports for Sept 1-5 were 51,900 tonnes, and the primary destinations were Israel, Mexico and Japan.</p>
</text>
